--     swing/hit — not a VFX layer, an actual targeting system.
--     Hit reactions are now cosmetic-only, driven off real
--     HealthChanged events like every other moveset in this thread.
-- [2] REMOVED: flight tool (free 3D movement) and click-teleport
--     tool. Same reasoning as always — real positioning advantage,
--     not a look. Run tool kept, but ground-speed only.
-- [3] FIXED: Move1's animation ID collided with its own trigger ID,
